<p>The pathways are sort of the modern version of appealing to a fairy godmother for some help/a little grandmotherly support.</p>
<p>Seeing these days people don't really have access a phone book where they can invite fairies to a child's birthday and local witches/wise women aren't really a thing, Foundation-verse fairy godmothers (or at least some of them) are in need of deserving people to help out. This is how they get in touch with those people.</p>
